comments.body:
To me [2.7.1](https://github.com/OWASP/ASVS/blob/master/5.0/en/0x11-V2-Authentication.md#v27-out-of-band-verifier) needs to be L1 but I would be open to [2.7.4](https://github.com/OWASP/ASVS/blob/master/5.0/en/0x11-V2-Authentication.md#v27-out-of-band-verifier) becoming level 2.

I think 2.2.2 is talking about primary authentication and 2.7.x is talking about MFA.

@ThunderSon how do you want to proceed?
